<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Once I was foolish, and sin ruled my heart,</l><l>Causing my footsteps from God to depart;</l><l>Jesus hath found me, happy my case;</l><l>I now am a sinner saved by grace!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Tears unavailing, no merit had I;</l><l>Mercy had saved me, or else I must die;</l><l>Sin had alarmed me, fearing God’s face;</l><l>But now I’m a sinner saved by grace!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Suffer a sinner whose heart overflows,</l><l>Loving his Savior to tell what he knows;</l><l>Once more to tell it, would I embrace—</l><l>I’m only a sinner saved by grace!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
